ill guide consideration (though they may evolve as the market grows) with final inclusion determined by a DAO vote.\nThe index is rebalanced every two weeks.\n","files":[]},"chainId":8453,"mandate":"The Zora Index (ZINDEX) is a dynamic token basket that tracks a curated selection of high-signal creator and cultural assets on Zora. The index is governed by holders of CreatorDAO’s $CREATOR token. The basket is designed to evolve over time, reflecting changes in creator activity, cultural momentum, and onchain engagement across Zora, while maintaining a focus on assets viewed as foundational within the ecosystem."}]